{"seq":1,"slug":"set-theory","title":"高一数学 — 集合论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/sets-logic/set-theory","wordCount":1734,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"高一数学-集合论\">高一数学 — 集合论</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>集合是高中数学的起始概念，也是整个现代数学的基础语言。集合论研究的是对象的聚集——将具有某种共同属性的对象放在一起构成一个整体，这个整体就是集合。高一阶段需要掌握：集合的概念与表示方法、集合之间的基本关系（子集、真子集、相等）、集合的基本运算（交集、并集、补集），以及用集合语言描述数学问题的能力。</p>\n<p>核心概念包括：元素与集合的关系（属于∈、不属于∉）、集合的确定性、互异性和无序性三大特性、常用数集的符号（自然数集ℕ、整数集ℤ、有理数集ℚ、实数集ℝ）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-集合的概念与表示\">一、集合的概念与表示</h3><p><strong>集合的三大特性</strong>：</p>\n<p>确定性——给定一个集合，任何一个对象是否属于这个集合是确定的。例如&quot;高个子的人&quot;不能构成集合（&quot;高个子&quot;标准不明确），但&quot;身高超过180cm的人&quot;可以构成集合。</p>\n<p>互异性——集合中的元素互不相同。集合{1, 1, 2}应写作{1, 2}。</p>\n<p>无序性——集合中元素的排列顺序不影响集合本身。{1, 2, 3} = {3, 1, 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>集合的表示方法</strong>：</p>\n<p>列举法：将集合的元素一一列出。如A = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5}。适用于元素个数有限且较少的情况。</p>\n<p>描述法：用元素的共同特征来表示集合。如B = {x | <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> - 1 = 0} = {-1, 1}。竖线前面的x是代表元素，竖线后面是元素满足的条件。</p>\n<p>图示法（Venn图）：用封闭曲线内部表示集合。直观形象，特别适合表示集合间的关系和运算。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-集合间的基本关系\">二、集合间的基本关系</h3><p><strong>子集</strong>：如果集合A中的每一个元素都是集合B的元素，则称A是B的子集，记作A⊆B。</p>\n<p><strong>真子集</strong>：如果A⊆B且A≠B，则称A是B的真子集，记作A⊊B。</p>\n<p><strong>集合相等</strong>：如果A⊆B且B⊆A，则A = B。这是证明两个集合相等的常用方法——互相包含法。</p>\n<p><strong>空集</strong>：不含任何元素的集合，记作∅。空集是任何集合的子集，是任何非空集合的真子集。</p>\n<p><strong>子集个数公式</strong>：含有n个元素的集合共有<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>个子集、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> - 1个真子集、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> - 1个非空子集、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> - 2个非空真子集。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关系</th>\n<th>记号</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>属于</td>\n<td>a∈A</td>\n<td>元素a在集合A中</td>\n<td>2∈{1,2,3}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不属于</td>\n<td>a∉A</td>\n<td>元素a不在集合A中</td>\n<td>4∉{1,2,3}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子集</td>\n<td>A⊆B</td>\n<td>A中每个元素都在B中</td>\n<td>{1,2}⊆{1,2,3}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真子集</td>\n<td>A⊊B</td>\n<td>A⊆B且A≠B</td>\n<td>{1,2}⊊{1,2,3}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相等</td>\n<td>A=B</td>\n<td>A⊆B且B⊆A</td>\n<td>{1,2}={2,1}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"三-集合的基本运算\">三、集合的基本运算</h3><p><strong>交集</strong>：A∩B = {x | x∈A 且 x∈B}，即同时属于A和B的所有元素组成的集合。</p>\n<p><strong>并集</strong>：A∪B = {x | x∈A 或 x∈B}，即属于A或属于B（或同时属于两者）的所有元素组成的集合。</p>\n<p><strong>补集</strong>：设全集为U，A⊆U，则A关于U的补集<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∁</mi><mi>U</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\complement_U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.975em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∁</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>A = {x | x∈U 且 x∉A}。</p>\n<p><strong>运算律</strong>：</p>\n<p>交换律：A∩B = B∩A，A∪B = B∪A</p>\n<p>结合律：(A∩B)∩C = A∩(B∩C)，(A∪B)∪C = A∪(B∪C)</p>\n<p>分配律：A∩(B∪C) = (A∩B)∪(A∩C)，A∪(B∩C) = (A∪B)∩(A∪C)</p>\n<p>德摩根律：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∁</mi><mi>U</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\complement_U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.975em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∁</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>(A∩B) = (<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∁</mi><mi>U</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\complement_U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.975em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∁</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>A)∪(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∁</mi><mi>U</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\complement_U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.975em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∁</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>B)，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∁</mi><mi>U</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\complement_U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.975em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∁</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>(A∪B) = (<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∁</mi><mi>U</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\complement_U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.975em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∁</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>A)∩(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∁</mi><mi>U</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\complement_U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.975em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∁</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>B)</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-集合与不等式\">四、集合与不等式</h3><p>集合论在高中数学中的一个重要应用是用集合语言表示不等式的解集。</p>\n<p>例如：解不等式<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> - 3x + 2 &lt; 0</p>\n<p>分解因式：(x-1)(x-2) &lt; 0</p>\n<p>解集为：{x | 1 &lt; x &lt; 2}，即开区间(1, 2)</p>\n<p>区间表示法是集合描述法的简化形式：开区间(a,b) = {x | a &lt; x &lt; b}，闭区间[a,b] = {x | a ≤ x ≤ b}，半开半闭区间[a,b) = {x | a ≤ x &lt; b}。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-典型题型与解法\">五、典型题型与解法</h3><p><strong>求参数问题</strong>：已知A = {1, 2, 3}，B = {1, a, 5}，若A∩B = {1, 3}，求a的值。</p>\n<p>分析：A∩B = {1, 3}说明3∈B，而B = {1, a, 5}，所以a = 3。验证：集合B = {1, 3, 5}满足互异性，A∩B = {1, 3}✓。</p>\n<p><strong>子集问题</strong>：求集合{a, b, c}的所有子集。</p>\n<p>解：共有<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 8个子集：∅, {a}, {b}, {c}, {a,b}, {a,c}, {b,c}, {a,b,c}。</p>\n<p><strong>集合运算综合问题</strong>：设U = ℝ，A = {x | -1 ≤ x &lt; 3}，B = {x | x &gt; 1}，求A∩B、A∪B、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∁</mi><mi>U</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\complement_U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.975em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∁</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>A∩B。</p>\n<p>A∩B = {x | 1 &lt; x &lt; 3}，A∪B = {x | x ≥ -1}，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∁</mi><mi>U</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\complement_U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.975em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∁</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>A = {x | x &lt; -1 或 x ≥ 3}，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∁</mi><mi>U</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\complement_U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.975em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∁</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>A∩B = {x | x ≥ 3}。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>用列举法表示集合A = {x∈ℤ | -2 &lt; x ≤ 3}，并求A的所有子集的个数。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>已知A = {x | <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> - 5x + 6 = 0}，B = {x | <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> - ax + a - 1 = 0}，若B⊆A，求实数a的取值范围。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设U = {1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8}，A = {1,3,5,7}，B = {2,4,5,6}，求A∩B、A∪B、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∁</mi><mi>U</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\complement_U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.975em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∁</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>(A∪B)、(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∁</mi><mi>U</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\complement_U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.975em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∁</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>A)∩(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∁</mi><mi>U</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\complement_U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.975em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∁</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>B)，并验证德摩根律。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>思考：为什么规定空集是任何集合的子集？如果不做此规定会带来什么逻辑问题？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>集合论是现代数学的基石，由德国数学家康托尔在19世纪末创立。深入了解集合论可以阅读：《什么是数学》（柯朗、罗宾斯著）中关于集合与逻辑的章节提供了直观的介绍。集合论的悖论（如罗素悖论）是数学哲学中的重要话题，了解这些悖论有助于理解数学基础的深层问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"sufficient-necessary\">充分必要条件</a> —— 充分必要条件正是用集合的包含关系（A⊆B）来直观判断的，是集合关系最直接的逻辑应用。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../functions/function-concept\">函数概念与性质</a> —— 函数的现代定义建立在&quot;两个非空数集之间的对应&quot;之上，定义域、值域本身就是集合，集合语言是理解函数定义的前提。</li>\n<li>跨学科（计算机基础·离散数学）：<a href=\"../../../../../cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/sets-and-relations/set-theory\">集合论</a> —— 大学离散数学中集合论的系统展开，包含幂集、笛卡尔积、关系等高中阶段未涉及的内容，是高中集合知识的自然延伸。</li>\n<li>跨学科（数学与统计·概率统计）：<a href=\"../../../../../mathematics-statistics/probability-statistics/probability-foundations/sample-space-events\">样本空间与事件</a> —— 概率论中的样本空间、事件、事件的交并补运算完全建立在集合运算之上，是集合论最重要的应用方向之一。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>集合论为高中数学提供了基本的语言工具和思维框架。掌握集合的概念、关系和运算后，能够用集合语言精确地描述数学对象和数学关系，这是后续学习函数、不等式、概率等内容的重要基础。关键是理解集合的三大特性，熟练掌握交集、并集、补集的运算规则及其在Venn图上的直观表示。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高一数学 — 集合论","id":"高一数学-集合论"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、集合的概念与表示","id":"一-集合的概念与表示"},{"level":3,"text":"二、集合间的基本关系","id":"二-集合间的基本关系"},{"level":3,"text":"三、集合的基本运算","id":"三-集合的基本运算"},{"level":3,"text":"四、集合与不等式","id":"四-集合与不等式"},{"level":3,"text":"五、典型题型与解法","id":"五-典型题型与解法"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"高一数学 — 逻辑联结词","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/sets-logic/logical-connectives"}}